    "body": "## Operator UI for the ontology system\n\nPalantir-style operator UI over agent-utilities' ontology system (pairs with agent-utilities `feat/ontology-system-palantir-parity`).\n\n- **ObjectExplorerView** \u2014 faceted search + filters, results table, pivot, search-around, bulk Actions (from real registered actions via `/ontology/actions`), save/list/load object sets.\n- **ObjectView** \u2014 single-object hub: typed + derived properties, in/out links, marking badges, edit-history timeline with inline edit/revert; full & panel form factors, standard & configured layouts.\n- **VertexView** \u2014 interactive node-edge scenario graph (sigma/xyflow), search-around expansion, derived-property inspection.\n- **Backend** \u2014 ~20 `/api/enhanced/ontology/*` routes in `agent/agent_webui/api_extensions.py` reaching `kg.ontology`; **22** endpoint tests pass.\n- **Wiring** \u2014 `api.ts` ontology methods (tsc-checked, no unsafe casts), `App.tsx` + `app-sidebar`.\n\n**Test-harness repair (pre-existing debt):** single React 19 copy via pnpm overrides (fixes the vitest null-dispatcher crash), excluded Playwright e2e from vitest, fixed broken `@/lib/api` mock factories, added jsdom WebGL + fetch-base shims, updated stale view tests to the live UI. Result: `pnpm typecheck` clean, `pnpm test` **92/92** across 13 files.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
